156: /**
157:   verifies the plugin and adds it to the list
158: 
159:   @param mysql          MYSQL structure (for error reporting)
160:   @param plugin         plugin to install
161:   @param dlhandle       a handle to the shared object (returned by dlopen)
162:                         or 0 if the plugin was not dynamically loaded
163:   @param argc           number of arguments in the 'va_list args'
